00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,280
I'll bring the flowers out.

2
00:00:02,702 --> 00:00:03,770
Oh, you came early.

3
00:00:04,571 --> 00:00:05,205
Hye-won!

4
00:00:05,205 --> 00:00:06,272
I heard the news.

5
00:00:06,272 --> 00:00:08,208
We don't have much time.
Let's get to work.

6
00:00:10,577 --> 00:00:11,577
You guys!

7
00:00:12,112 --> 00:00:13,246
You guys are really...

8
00:00:13,246 --> 00:00:14,280
Not now.

9
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:15,181
We don't have time.

10
00:00:15,248 --> 00:00:16,248
Oh, alright.

11
00:00:24,491 --> 00:00:26,359
I'm such a lucky boss.

12
00:00:27,594 --> 00:00:30,130
My employees rush to help me
when I'm in trouble.

13
00:00:30,463 --> 00:00:33,299
I can't believe I was
scheming behind their backs.

14
00:00:33,900 --> 00:00:36,436
Guys, thank you so much.

15
00:00:36,436 --> 00:00:37,771
I couldn't have done it
without you.

16
00:00:37,771 --> 00:00:40,473
I'll be sure to treat you
big time.

17
00:00:40,473 --> 00:00:41,473
I really appreciate it.

18
00:00:41,975 --> 00:00:43,510
Go home now, okay?

19
00:00:44,210 --> 00:00:45,210
You went through a lot.

20
00:00:45,378 --> 00:00:46,378
Okay.

21
00:00:46,746 --> 00:00:48,114
I'll see you next week.

22
00:00:48,114 --> 00:00:49,115
Hye-won, wait a second.

23
00:00:49,783 --> 00:00:51,383
How did you find out
about the situation?

24
00:00:51,651 --> 00:00:53,453
Eun-ho called me yesterday.

25
00:00:53,453 --> 00:00:55,197
He said you made
a huge trouble for yourself.

26
00:00:55,221 --> 00:00:56,689
Do you guys call each other?

27
00:00:56,956 --> 00:00:58,725
Yes. We're co-workers,
you know.

28
00:00:59,225 --> 00:01:00,827
But you never call me.

29
00:01:01,694 --> 00:01:02,729
I'll see you next week.

30
00:01:02,996 --> 00:01:03,996
Hey!

31
00:01:07,467 --> 00:01:09,469
They call each other
in private?

